---
title: How to Print an Invoice?
sidebar:
  order: 13
---
**To print an invoice:**

1. **Go to the “Invoices” section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Invoices” to view the list of invoices.**

1. **Select the invoice to print:**

   - **Find the invoice you wish to print from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the invoice.**
